; ODbL applies to OSM-derived spatial data. Reference photographs retain their own licenses.","assistance":"AI-assisted architectural interpretation and procedural recipe authoring; deterministic Python/Blender export. No photographic textures.","review":{"status":"pending","reviewer":null,"checks":{}},"modelingNotes":["The OSM footprint defines the full museum and one unheighted entrance part. The 20 m crown and 13 m wing eave are inferred from selected 2011 and 2016 exterior photographs.","A round drum and shallow dome above the corner entrance are the defining street silhouette. Radius and cornice levels are schematic; the rounded south end of the mapped outline locates the drum.","Pale masonry, tall wall windows and a restrained roofline replace sculpture, banners and roof equipment at this scale."],"source":{"url":"/objects/9d4c12c1e2d1a032f66ae4cd6a7caf6207feefce4b8808e677bd307229ad64f6/source.blend.gz","bytes":111199,"sha256":"9d4c12c1e2d1a032f66ae4cd6a7caf6207feefce4b8808e677bd307229ad64f6"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/97f6a0646d98181aad48ec39cb2a3bef82238a2f6498b05c799a480f574eac8b/spatial-source.json","bytes":6693,"sha256":"97f6a0646d98181aad48ec39cb2a3bef82238a2f6498b05c799a480f574eac8b"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/b75f179e28e71fd7cb97acaa42b5753877fcd5bc2bf8935e7b6569c0093a389b/preview.webp","bytes":5158,"sha256":"b75f179e28e71fd7cb97acaa42b5753877fcd5bc2bf8935e7b6569c0093a389b"},"previewDirection":[1,0.4,2],"revision":"5ea5216364bd9ba88844a1cb12c8691f657bea894adbe8e3322686c25a8ae31c","publicationRevision":"3ef4032a85fb1ba34099736fd5802e1956eace5d6365d95631df1b9d708e423f","bounds":[2.2930598,48.8650466,2.2940584,48.8657307],"approved":false,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"121eb8f661cd76df4f6ea710947bfce0cace2e6aef7fda643b2d4407a7fbb3c9","url":"/materials/121eb8f661cd76df4f6ea710947bfce0cace2e6aef7fda643b2d4407a7fbb3c9.json"},"metadata":"/assets/musee-guimet/3ef4032a85fb1ba34099736fd5802e1956eace5d6365d95631df1b9d708e423f/asset.json","